    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44811" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sortĭlĕgus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		sors-lego, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>foretelling</i>, <i>prophetic.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			adj.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Delphi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 219</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sortĭlĕgus</span></b> , i,
				m., <i>a fortune-teller</i>, <i>soothsayer</i>, <i>diviner</i> by
			lots or from oracles, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 6, § 65</span></i>
			Müll.; <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 1, 58, 132</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 53,
				109</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 9, 581</span></i>. </div>
